      "q": "What does Canadian Commercial sell to the government?",
      "a": "Canadian Commercial sells products and services in several defense and aerospace-related markets. Canadian Commercial obligations are highest in Military Armored Vehicle, Tank, and Tank Component Manufacturing ($439M), and also include Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing ($77.1M), Explosives Manufacturing ($63.5M), and Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing ($30.8M), among others."
